Further, once you allowed login access to a person, you’ll see a field on that person’s profile called Access Details”. Here you can setup the following;
You can set a default cost code for that person so when that person uses time cards, that cost code will be automatically selected. But if in any case that person needs to change the cost code for a time card, it is allowed. Take User Directly to Timecard: If you turn this on, whenever that person opens Contractor Foreman, he/she will be redirected to the Time cards module. This can be useful if you have employees on the field who primarily use the time cards module. So those people don’t have to find and navigate to the time cards module on their own. Viewable Projects: You can restrict the employee or the contractor from seeing all projects of your company when he/she logs in by only selecting the appropriate project in here. If you select any, that person will only see those projects. But if you don’t select any, the person will see all the projects of your company. Keep in mind that depending on plan or subscription you will have a limited number of users. To learn more about this go to Contractor Foreman Plans
